wander|PASS: Unplanned movement is distinguished from wonder rather than assigned a mental-process noun. Through the harbour streets and until sunset are faithfully translated; route-preposition guidance is reusable.
cultivate|REVIEW: Growing plants and deliberate habit development retain separate source ordinals and transitive objects. The agricultural grammar's final-syllable spelling claim is misleading; replace it with useful cultivation guidance via overlay.
format|PASS: Presentation arrangement supports a question-and-answer interview without forcing a digital file interpretation. Noun POS and of/in constructions are checked; hình thức hỏi đáp is natural in Vietnamese.
methodology|PASS: A coordinated system of methods is distinguished from one technique. The survey comparison is fictional and claims no validated research outcome; the Vietnamese gloss includes both common and precise choices.
network|REVIEW: Connected equipment and social cooperation are different draft boundaries proposed within one broad source ordinal. Do not infer distinct canonical identities from this split; the full split and contact/system coverage need owner review.
